1. WHAT THIS COVERS
-------------------

"Software" means the Ttkdesigner desktop application, including the
Ttkdesigner.exe launcher, the compiled application data (data/ directory,
app.so, and platform libraries), bundled assets, and any accompanying
documentation distributed with it.

"Trial Build" means any distribution marked as 体验版 / Trial.
"Full Version" means any distribution marked as 正式版 / Full.

This repository (github.com/ttkdesigner/ttkdesigner) hosts documentation,
screenshots, and release binaries only. It does not contain the Software's
source code, and nothing in this license grants any right to that source code.


