     add or remove files, or repackage it, and you may not charge a fee for
     it or present it as your own work.
  d) Use, modify, publish, and sell any Python source code that you generate
     with the Software. See section 4.

You may not:

  e) Use features that the Trial Build does not provide. Attempting to unlock,
     bypass, or work around restricted features is a breach of this license.
  f) Modify, rebrand, or remove or alter any copyright, version, or branding
