6. AI FEATURES, YOUR DATA, AND THIRD-PARTY SERVICES
---------------------------------------------------

The Software includes an AI design assistant. It does not provide AI models.
It sends your request, and the current canvas content used as context, to
whichever AI service you configure in the Software.

You are responsible for that configuration. You supply your own API
credentials, you choose the endpoint, and your use of that service is governed
by that provider's own terms and privacy policy, not by this license.

The author of the Software:

  a) Does not operate, control, or endorse any third-party AI service that the
     Software can be configured to use, including any relay or gateway service
     suggested in the interface. Any such suggestion is informational only.
  b) Does not receive, store, or have access to the content you send to a
     third-party AI service, or to the credentials you configure.
  c) Makes no representation about the accuracy, legality, availability, cost,
     or data practices of any third-party AI service.

Do not send content to a third-party AI service that you are not permitted to
disclose. If you work with confidential material, review your provider's data
retention terms before using the AI features.


